  "contentHtml": " \n <div><div></div><br><div><!--IMG1--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/72283440.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG1--><br><div>Энэ зураг бол Инка овгийн 15 настай охины зураг, түүнийг Аргентин-Перу-гийн хамтарсан экспедиц 6739 метрийн өндөр дэх Луллайлако уулын оргилоос хөлдүүгээр нь олжээ. Сонирхолтой нь 500 жилийн өмнөх гэдэг нь тогтоогдсон уг шарил маш сайн хадгалагдсан байжээ. Түүнийг шинжээчид дүгнэхдээ, хордуулсныхаа дараагаар уулын оргилд аваачиж хаясан гэж дүгнэсэн байна.<br><div><!--IMG2--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/89572714.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG2--><br><!--IMG3--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/64197069.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG3--><br><!--IMG4--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/47390165.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/s47390165.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG4--><br><div>Чили улсын нутаг дэвсгэр \"Llullaillaco Maiden” уулын ноён оргил дахь мөнх \nцэвдгээс маш сайн хадгалагдсан цогцсыг шинжээчид 1999 онд гаргаж авчээ. \n 500 жилийн өмнөх эл цогцос нь мөнх цэвдэгт маш сайн хадгалагдсан учраас\n ямар нэгэн муудсан эрхтэнгүй бүрэн бүтнээрээ байсан байна. <br></div><!--IMG5--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/69983194.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG5--><br><!--IMG6--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/93649656.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG6--><br><!--IMG7--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/34501664.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG7--><br><!--IMG8--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/52482612.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/s52482612.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG8--><br><!--IMG9--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/79568121.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG9--><br><!--IMG10--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/66894567.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG10--><br><!--IMG11--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/57633817.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG11--><br><!--IMG12--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/28815303.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG12--><br><!--IMG13--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/40257344.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG13--><br><!--IMG14--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/38912701.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/s38912701.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG14--><br><!--IMG15--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/11189730.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG15--><br><!--IMG16--><a href=\"http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/77056956.jpeg\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Click to view in full size...\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/s77056956.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><!--IMG16--><br><!--IMG17--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/35092853.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG17--><br><!--IMG18--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20130310063057im_/http://www.horiotoi.org/_nw/40/47495385.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><!--IMG18--><br><br><br></div></div></div><div><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Kz6QtNQBCkA\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Архивын видео\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\"></iframe></div></div>\n \n \n ",
